  "_fields": "As in sp5.json. VideoHub's configurator (Advanced settings) is the newer one; it has no Dashboard, so desktop opens on the first page after the read. Pop-up steps click English texts. cropLast: cut out the last match of crop, for a pop-up opened over another one.",
